00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:09.163
<v Narrator>A farko, mutane sun biya dubban daloli don bincika rubutun su a kansu, amma yau yana zuwa kyauta a duk inda aka samu.

2
00:00:09.243 --> 00:00:18.209
<v Narrator>Na biyu, ya zama kyauta saboda duba kalmomi ba zai kashe komai ba wajen tafiyar da kayan aikin da kake amfani da su.

3
00:00:18.289 --> 00:00:28.190
<v Narrator>Na uku, sabon ilimin kwamfuta ya kai biliyan bakwai kawai idan yana aiki da farashin mai arha a kan na'urori da mutane ke da su.
